qwen35-rust

This crate reimplements inference for the Qwen3.5-0.8B model in Rust. It does not
include or modify the model's source code; it embeds a quantised copy of the
published weights and reads two files of the release (the tokenizer and the chat
template) to build its own reader.

The model weights, configuration, tokenizer and chat template are Apache-2.0
licensed work of the Qwen team (Alibaba). The operator-level reading was taken
from the Hugging Face Transformers implementation, which is also Apache-2.0.

Every file this build derives from is listed in THIRD-PARTY.md with its byte
length and SHA256. Those hashes are the identity of the inputs: the local
snapshot does not carry the upstream commit id.
